{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>&quot;We didn't build the sign.&quot;</strong></i><br>Those five words changed everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a devastating storm sweeps across northern Japan, a rescue helicopter is dispatched to search for two hikers who vanished the day before. As night falls and hope begins to fade, something unexpected emerges from the mist: a massive SOS sign, carved deep into the earth. Minutes later, the hikers are found alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But what happens next is where the story begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Lost Tape</strong> is a narrative-driven psychological horror game based on a real unsolved mystery. Built around the original narration from Nexpo\u2019s acclaimed investigative video, the game invites you to not just witness the story \u2014 but experience it firsthand.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702550/extras/SmallCapsule.png?t=1748447513\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Narration from Nexpo</strong>: The original story, told exactly as it was \u2014 with added dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple unique perspectives</strong>: Start as a helicopter pilot scanning the terrain; later, walk the trail as a hiker and investigate the case as a police officer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive horror without gimmicks</strong>: No combat, no jump scares. Just atmosphere, sound, and the dread of uncovering too much.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration-focused gameplay</strong>: Search fog-covered forests, follow faint signs of life, and uncover strange remnants left behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Built in Unreal Engine 4</strong> with moody, realistic environments and environmental storytelling at the core.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But be warned:<br>Some things should never be found.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702550?t=1748447513","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702550/717ca98bba1748360eb361ea2568b6742131b2a3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748447513","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702550/10a7ea33347f88f1ee29e19ef07dcf490167d22a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748447513","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702550/10a7ea33347f88f1ee29e19ef07dcf490167d22a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748447513","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>&quot;We didn't build the sign.&quot;</strong></i><br>Those five words changed everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a devastating storm sweeps across northern Japan, a rescue helicopter is dispatched to search for two hikers who vanished the day before. As night falls and hope begins to fade, something unexpected emerges from the mist: a massive SOS sign, carved deep into the earth. Minutes later, the hikers are found alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But what happens next is where the story begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Lost Tape</strong> is a narrative-driven psychological horror game based on a real unsolved mystery. Built around the original narration from Nexpo\u2019s acclaimed investigative video, the game invites you to not just witness the story \u2014 but experience it firsthand.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702550/extras/SmallCapsule.png?t=1748447513\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Narration from Nexpo</strong>: The original story, told exactly as it was \u2014 with added dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple unique perspectives</strong>: Start as a helicopter pilot scanning the terrain; later, walk the trail as a hiker and investigate the case as a police officer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive horror without gimmicks</strong>: No combat, no jump scares. Just atmosphere, sound, and the dread of uncovering too much.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration-focused gameplay</strong>: Search fog-covered forests, follow faint signs of life, and uncover strange remnants left behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Built in Unreal Engine 4</strong> with moody, realistic environments and environmental storytelling at the core.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But be warned:<br>Some things should never be found.</p>","developers":["PackDev"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702550/7c773ab059b12bd627b57221da3f1f42c6732647/header.jpg?t=1748447513","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"The Lost Tape ","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 / AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 / AMD Radeon RX 470 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Co